      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……神速一魂の2人、まだやってるか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_09_f:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_09_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_09_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 24,
          "target_step_index": 4
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "うん。リハ終わったのに、ずーっと自主練してる。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "御手洗 翔太"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_09_f:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_09_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_09_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 24,
          "target_step_index": 7
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あー、僕もう先輩としてカッコつけるの、\n疲れて来ちゃったよ～～！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "御手洗 翔太"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_09_f:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_09_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_09_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 24,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ふふ。そう言いながら、\n翔太も練習やめる気がないよね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "伊集院 北斗"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_09_f:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_09_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_09_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 24,
          "target_step_index": 11
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "翔太も北斗も、わかってんだろ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_09_f:step-15:text",
        "step_id": 15,
        "step_index": 14,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_09_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_09_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 24,
          "target_step_index": 14
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "同じステージに立つ以上、ライバルは他事務所の\nアイドルだけじゃない。315プロの連中も同じだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_09_f:step-16:text",
        "step_id": 16,
        "step_index": 15,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_09_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_09_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 24,
          "target_step_index": 15
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "315プロで、一二を争うくらい熱いユニット……。\nあの神速一魂だって、超えてやるぜ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_09_f:step-17:text",
        "step_id": 17,
        "step_index": 16,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_09_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_09_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 24,
          "target_step_index": 16
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "これだから熱血は嫌だねー。\nすぐ周りの人たちとバトっちゃうんだから。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "御手洗 翔太"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_09_f:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_09_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_09_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 24,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "それが冬馬だからね。『熱い』って言葉は、\n冬馬のためにあるんじゃないかな？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "伊集院 北斗"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_09_f:step-21:text",
        "step_id": 21,
        "step_index": 20,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_09_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_09_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 24,
          "target_step_index": 20
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "とか言いつつ、おまえらだって\nずっと練習に付き合ってんじゃねぇか。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_09_f:step-22:text",
        "step_id": 22,
        "step_index": 21,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_09_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_09_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 24,
          "target_step_index": 21
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "へへ……やっぱ燃えるよな、アイドルって！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_09_f:step-23:text",
        "step_id": 23,
        "step_index": 22,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_09_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_09_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 24,
          "target_step_index": 22
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "北斗、翔太。明日は、最高のJupiterの姿を\nみんなに見せてやろうぜ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
